  "sync": "\n    <div class=\"clinical-onboarding-stage\">\n      <div class=\"clinical-onboarding-stage-inner\">\n        <div class=\"clinical-onboarding-progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Progreso del registro\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"3\" aria-valuenow=\"1\">\n          <span class=\"clinical-onboarding-progress-label\">Paso 1 de 3 · Modo</span>\n          <span class=\"clinical-onboarding-progress-track\"><span class=\"is-active\"></span><span class=\"\"></span><span class=\"\"></span></span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"clinical-onboarding-title\">¿Cómo usarás R+?</h3>\n        <div class=\"clinical-onboarding-lead\"><p>Elige cómo usarás R+ en este equipo. Con Nube creas cuenta o entras si ya tienes una; en solo equipo trabajas sin sincronizar.</p></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-grid\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Modo de uso\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card clinical-onboard-mode-card--primary\" data-sync-mode=\"nube\">\n            <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-icon-wrap\"><svg class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-icon\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"/></svg></span>\n            <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-head\">\n              <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-title\">Guardia con R+ Cloud</span>\n              <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-desc\">Crea tu @usuario, elige rotación y sincroniza censo y equipos por <strong>Nube</strong>.</span>\n            </span>\n            <svg class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-chevron\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg>\n          </button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card\" data-sync-mode=\"existing\">\n            <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-icon-wrap\"><svg class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-icon\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4\"/><polyline points=\"10 17 15 12 10 7\"/><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"3\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></span>\n            <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-head\">\n              <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-title\">Ya tengo cuenta</span>\n              <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-desc\">Inicia sesión en Nube, recuerda este dispositivo y restaura tu censo y <strong>Mi rotación</strong>.</span>\n            </span>\n            <svg class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-chevron\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg>\n          </button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card\" data-sync-mode=\"local\">\n            <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-icon-wrap\"><svg class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-icon\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 21h8\"/><path d=\"M12 17v4\"/></svg></span>\n            <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-head\">\n              <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-title\">Solo este equipo</span>\n              <span class=\"clinical-onboard-mode-card-desc\">Sin Nube: expedientes y notas solo en esta Mac. Sin rotacione